ay Progression\n- Level 0 - The Lobby Level: A safe zone to inspect 1:1 scale models of landmines and practice in detecting mines.\n- Level 1 - Surface Threats: Practice spotting visible surface-level hazards and executing remote destruction protocols from cover.\n- Level 2 - Sub-Surface Search: Sweep areas for hidden dangers and use realistic digging mechanics to carefully clear soil.\n\n### \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Key Features\n- Interactive Tool Belt: Utilize functional virtual tools tailored for spatial VR interactions.\n- Tactile Mechanics: Experience realistic digging physics and object manipulation.\n- Immersive Atmosphere: Spatial audio and full-body presence ground you in the environment.\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Important Disclaimer\nThis simulator is intended solely for educational, informational, and awareness purposes. The representations shown do not constitute certification, authorization, or official training for real-world explosive handling or hazardous device intervention.\nBy playing, you acknowledge that:\n- This experience is a simulation only.\n- You are not qualified to perform real demining operations.\n- Attempting to replicate these actions in the real world may result in serious injuries.", "short_description": "Demining Academy VR is an educational sandbox simulation that introduces players to basic mine awareness. Explore 1:1 scale models, learn standard safety protocols, and practice identifying virtual hazards in a safe, interactive environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/TheDeiw/Demining-Academy/blob/main/Demining%20Academy%20Policy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TheDeiw's Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://thedeiw.github.io/TheDeiwGames/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "